   "annotation_text": "Participants will attend an outpatient follow-up visit 7 (± 2) days after the final dose of study intervention. If participants are not able to attend the CRU for this visit, the CRU should contact the participant via phone call to conduct adverse event and concomitant medication review. If applicable, ED assessments should be performed on the day of discontinuation (or as close to it as possible).",
